	"title"		"More Nodes/Segments [Close Beta]"
	"description"		"[h1]More Nodes/Segments [Close Beta - Friends Only][/h1]
[b]Bản thử nghiệm kín dành riêng cho bạn bè và cộng tác viên thử nghiệm.[/b]

[h2]Revert về bản Close Beta v5.0.15:[/h2]
- Crash & Compatibility Shield: Neutralized unsafe Core KianCommons reflection loop before HarmonyBootstrap.Enable() to prevent native mono.dll 0xc0000005 access violation.
- Expanded Stops & Stations (1776052533) PassengerCountLimiter passengerCount buffer to 65,536 elements with simulation tick armor, eliminating recurring IndexOutOfRangeException in ThreadingWrapper on cities > 32K nodes.
- Normalized TM:PE ExtSegmentEnds & SegmentEnds buffer allocations to 130,048 (CORE_SPLIT_CAPACITY) to eliminate MNC Core length validation errors.
- Hardened EightyOne 2 Water CustomSerialize with null-safe pulse unit copying and fallback to native serializer.
- Armored ModsCommon CustomUITextField text selection bounds against ArgumentOutOfRangeException.
- Preserved 100% native traffic simulation with zero TM:PE hooks.

[i]Developed by NgocDuy.[/i]"
	"changenote"		"v5.0.15 Close Beta: Reverted to stable v5.0.15 baseline (Crash & Compatibility Shield, 65K Stops/Stations, 130K buffer normalization, and 100% native traffic simulation)."
